tasks.description:
handleViral(chatId, ownerChatId): owner-only gate. Reads workspace/scs001/viral-topics.json — takes topics[] array, slices first 10. Gets file mtime via fs.statSync for freshness ('Updated: N hours ago' or 'Updated: today HH:MM'). Message format: '🔥 *Viral Topics* — top 10 trending
_(Updated: {freshness})_

1. {topic1}
2. {topic2}
...
10. {topic10}

💡 Use these as your next video topics.
→ /today for today's target | /queue for ready videos'. If viral-topics.json missing or empty: '⚠️ No viral topics yet — pipeline must run first. Check /queue.'. Also add '/viral — Top 10 trending topics from pipeline (owner)' to handleHelp.
